# Detection

DNS Activity

## Objective

Review DNS queries generated by endpoint processes.

## Analyst Question

Which domains were queried during the investigation?

## Data Source

Sysmon DNS Events

## SPL

```spl
index=main dns
| table _time QueryName Image User host
| sort _time
```

## Expected Output

A chronological list of DNS requests associated with endpoint processes.

## Investigation Notes

DNS requests often precede outbound network communication. Correlating DNS activity with process creation and network connections provides additional investigative context.
